    "text": "A current of <math><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> passes through a copper conductor (resistivity <math><mo>=</mo><mn>1.7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> ) of radius of cross-section <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> . Find the mobility of the charges if their drift velocity is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1.1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi>ms</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> .",
